# Cold start to 240, then 120 s holds at 220, 240, 220. Start with the nozzle at room temperature.
# Reproduces logs/side_cold1.log. Score with score_cold.py; the holds show the step response.
M155 S1;2
# Hotend idle timeout off, or it cuts the heater 360 s after passing 180 C
M86 S0;2
# Record the MPC constants in the log. Add e.g. "M306 E0 D5 K0.1;2" here to test other values.
M306;2
M109 S240;ok
M105;120
M104 S220;120
M104 S240;120
M104 S220;120
M104 S0;1
# Restore the idle timeout
M86 S360 T180 E0 B0;2
